# Blog image provenance crawl: commit only the JSON sidecars (small, durable
# provenance carrying a public image_url). Keep raw image binaries out of git
# (~4GB, re-fetchable from image_url), regardless of extension case. The photo
# holding pen is not committed.
blog_images/**
!blog_images/
!blog_images/**/
!blog_images/**/*.json
blog_images_photos/
